    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s3",
   "date": null,
   "url": "https://www.energy.gov/ceser/articles/doe-delivers-initial-risk-assessment-artificial-intelligence-critical-energy",
   "text": "This assessment is a critical contribution to the safety, security, and governance of artificial intelligence in the energy sector,",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Helena Fu",
    "organization_id": "energy",
    "basis": "local_span",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s4",
   "date": null,
   "url": "https://www.energy.gov/ceser/articles/doe-delivers-initial-risk-assessment-artificial-intelligence-critical-energy",
   "text": "DOE is turning aspirations into action, leveraging the transformative potential of AI to address pressing needs such as enhancing the cybersecurity of the power grid, engineering new materials for batteries, and building the next-generation of grid-scale storage solutions.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Helena Fu",
    "organization_id": "energy",
    "basis": "local_span",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s5",
   "date": "2023-12-13",
   "url": "https://www.energy.gov/sites/default/files/2023-12/December%2013%202023%20HEC%20AI%20hearing%20on%20Artificial%20Intelligence%20Final%20Testimony_0.pdf",
   "text": "At the same time, the rapid pace of AI development, accelerating investment by global competitors, and widespread AI access also carry unprecedented risks.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Helena Fu",
    "organization_id": "energy",
    "basis": "document_author",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s6",
   "date": "2023-12-13",
   "url": "https://www.energy.gov/sites/default/files/2023-12/December%2013%202023%20HEC%20AI%20hearing%20on%20Artificial%20Intelligence%20Final%20Testimony_0.pdf",
   "text": "The Biden-Harris Administration is also addressing the significant risks that AI presents to our safety and security, democracy, economy, and civil and human rights.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Helena Fu",
    "organization_id": "energy",
    "basis": "document_author",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s7",
   "date": "2023-12-13",
   "url": "https://www.energy.gov/sites/default/files/2023-12/December%2013%202023%20HEC%20AI%20hearing%20on%20Artificial%20Intelligence%20Final%20Testimony_0.pdf",
   "text": "The Administration is tackling these risks head-on by securing voluntary commitments from major AI companies, issuing a landmark Executive Order on Artificial Intelligence, and releasing for public comment a draft Office of Management and Budget (OMB) policy for the use of AI by the U.S. government.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Helena Fu",
    "organization_id": "energy",
    "basis": "document_author",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s8",
   "date": "2023-12-13",
   "url": "https://www.energy.gov/sites/default/files/2023-12/December%2013%202023%20HEC%20AI%20hearing%20on%20Artificial%20Intelligence%20Final%20Testimony_0.pdf",
   "text": "Global investment and competition in AI are increasing, and our continued leadership – whether public sector or private – is not assured.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Helena Fu",
    "organization_id": "energy",
    "basis": "document_author",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s9",
   "date": "2023-12-13",
   "url": "https://www.energy.gov/sites/default/files/2023-12/December%2013%202023%20HEC%20AI%20hearing%20on%20Artificial%20Intelligence%20Final%20Testimony_0.pdf",
   "text": "For example, China has moved to replicate the model and investments of the DOE’s National Laboratory system and is investing heavily in its own AI capabilities and workforce.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Helena Fu",
    "organization_id": "energy",
    "basis": "document_author",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s10",
   "date": "2023-12-13",
   "url": "https://www.energy.gov/sites/default/files/2023-12/December%2013%202023%20HEC%20AI%20hearing%20on%20Artificial%20Intelligence%20Final%20Testimony_0.pdf",
   "text": "Retaining leadership in AI will require developing trustworthy AI systems that can be deployed for high-consequence uses, from healthcare to aerospace.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Helena Fu",
    "organization_id": "energy",
    "basis": "document_author",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s11",
   "date": "2023-12-13",
   "url": "https://www.energy.gov/sites/default/files/2023-12/December%2013%202023%20HEC%20AI%20hearing%20on%20Artificial%20Intelligence%20Final%20Testimony_0.pdf",
   "text": "Protecting Americans’ rights and safety will require alignment of national investments and policies to evaluate and mitigate risks that can be exacerbated by AI advancements.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Helena Fu",
    "organization_id": "energy",
    "basis": "document_author",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s12",
   "date": "2023-12-13",
   "url": "https://www.energy.gov/sites/default/files/2023-12/December%2013%202023%20HEC%20AI%20hearing%20on%20Artificial%20Intelligence%20Final%20Testimony_0.pdf",
   "text": "In short, a robust partnership between the government, our private sector, and like-minded allies and partners is essential to ensuring that this technology is underpinned by democratic principles and values, and that all Americans benefit from its adoption and are safe from potential harms.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Helena Fu",
    "organization_id": "energy",
    "basis": "document_author",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
